# Docker build context for the verifier Lambda image (Dockerfile; design 5.13).
# Only what the build stage COPYs reaches the image: package.json, package-lock.json, tsconfig.json,
# eslint.config.mjs, eslint.config.d.mts, src/, eslint-plugin-lore/ and contract/. Keep those out of
# this list. Everything below is local-only: tests, fixtures and the corpus result are not needed by
# the image (the RIE script reads them from the checkout), and node_modules/dist are rebuilt inside
# the build stage (`npm ci`, `npm run build`), so a host copy would be wrong and large.
**/node_modules
**/dist
tests/
fixtures/
.corpus-results.json
.scratch/
coverage/
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
.env*
# Dev-only configuration, not used by `npm ci` or `npm run build`.
eslint.package.config.mjs
vitest.config.ts
.nvmrc
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
